- op: discuss  # abd5
  at: '2026-09-28T14:56:42Z'  # abd5
  by: agent  # abd5
  actor: jgstern_agent  # abd5
  clock: 4  # abd5
  nonce: abd5  # abd5
  message: "DONE in PR #1279 (merged). _try_receiver_call no longer ends with the receiver-blind method_resolver short-name lookup. A project constant that does not declare the method keeps an unresolved edge with receiver_type_hint = the constant, and the inherited-calls linker resolves it through the ancestors (Kid.make -> Base.make; User.authenticate -> HasAuthentication.authenticate via a mixin). A constant the project does not declare falls to the existing constant-external fallback. Found while measuring: the qualified lookup kept a leading '::', so '::Redis::Alfred.delete' (chatwoot, 25 calls) had resolved ONLY through the removed fallback. The prefix is now stripped, with the literal spelling tried second for a class declared as '::Foo::Bar'.\n\nBEHAVIOURAL EVIDENCE, the row's repro on merged dev (scratchpad johib/):\n  Rails.root.join       -> rails:0-0:root   (was HealthServer#root)\n  Postal::Config.root   -> Config:0-0:root, unresolved with receiver_type_hint (was HealthServer#root)\n  File.read(p)          -> file:0-0:read    (was HealthServer#read)\n  HealthServer.new.root -> HealthServer#root (control)\n  With a user overlay rowing File.read: must_not_exist fs_read claim inconclusive (blaming HealthServer) -> VIOLATED.\nTests: test_ruby_constant_receiver.py (8). test_ruby.py::test_receiver_call_resolver_fallback pinned the defect itself (Finder.locate -> Admin::UserFinder#locate) and was re-pinned to the fixed behaviour.\n\nA/B (record ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/johib_09282026/RESULT.md; the census is a hand-built instrument):\n  postal    constant-receiver calls bound to a DIFFERENT class: 54 -> 2 (one right via the linker, one wrong: see residual)\n  chatwoot  287 -> 0\n  Same-class bindings lost, checked edge by edge: postal 0, chatwoot 0.\nRESIDUAL, filed separately: the scope_resolution short-name candidate matches any project class with the same LAST segment (Prometheus::Client.registry -> project Client -> HasPrometheusMetrics.registry), because ruby symbol names carry no namespace to compare."  # abd5
